Create a new route `/codebase-summary/` for the existing Pi Dashboard web server.

## What to build

A page that displays a live codebase summary generated by running `pi -p 'Create a summary of this codebase'` from the CLI. The user clicks an "Update" button to refresh it, and up to 3 historical snapshots are kept.

## Files to create/modify

### 1. NEW: `/home/pmpmt/.pi/html/codebase-summary/index.html`
The HTML page. Must use the exact same dark theme CSS variables as the dashboard:
```
--bg:       #0f1117;
--surface:  #1a1d27;
--border:   #2a2d3a;
--text:     #e1e4ed;
--muted:    #8b8fa3;
--accent:   #6c8cff;
--green:    #4ade80;
--orange:   #fb923c;
--red:      #f87171;
--purple:   #c084fc;
--cyan:     #22d3ee;
```

